1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 13]</font>

15
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

16
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome home, Your Highness.</font>

17
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rise, Bai.</font>

18
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've endured much these years.</font>

19
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fuhai.</font>

20
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The keys.</font>

21
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're too noble and delicate</font>

22
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bow your head for me.</font>

23
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone thought I was finished.</font>

24
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only you</font>

25
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still kept my affairs
close to your heart.</font>

26
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should do something for you in return.</font>

27
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take you to a fine place.</font>

28
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu,</font>

29
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how is the Prince's health?</font>

30
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

31
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My cold is almost gone.</font>

32
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

33
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

34
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall take my leave now.</font>

35
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only been a morning.</font>

36
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you recover so quickly?</font>

37
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is</font>

38
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">thanks</font>

39
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your meticulous care.</font>

40
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allow me to think</font>

41
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about how I should reward you.</font>

42
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you're well now,</font>

43
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take this medicine away.</font>

44
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This place</font>

45
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is called Nightfall Haven.</font>

46
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An underground trading market,</font>

47
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">open at the Zi hour</font>

48
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and closed at the Mao hour.</font>

49
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only those of high rank</font>

50
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or with immense wealth are admitted.</font>

51
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[List]</font>

52
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai, what do you think</font>

53
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of this place?</font>

54
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has everything one could want.</font>

55
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything can be traded here.</font>

56
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With such a treasury backing it,</font>

57
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you now</font>

58
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have the power to rival the court.</font>

59
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

60
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is one thing I don't understand.</font>

61
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given Nightfall Haven's scale,</font>

62
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there must be many merchants.</font>

63
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why does the ledger</font>

64
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">show such a surplus of goods?</font>

65
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nightfall Haven's location is unique.</font>

66
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Frequent trips are inconvenient.</font>

67
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stocking extra goods for emergencies</font>

68
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is nothing unusual.</font>

69
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As Eunuch Fuhai says,</font>

70
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nightfall Haven's procurement intervals</font>

71
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are longer than those of ordinary shops.</font>

72
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the ledgers</font>

73
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">curiously record a large amount</font>

74
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of perishable fresh seafood.</font>

75
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet the futures are updated daily.</font>

76
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this continues,</font>

77
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stock will surely expire
and be discarded.</font>

78
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is truly a poor strategy.</font>

79
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In my humble opinion,</font>

80
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear some servants
are cooking the books,</font>

81
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lining their own pockets.</font>

82
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare they</font>

83
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">throw dust in my eyes?</font>

84
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have the one in charge</font>

85
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">flayed and torn apart!</font>

86
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, hold on.</font>

87
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Officials have dignity;
merchants have ethics.</font>

88
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only then can things be
upright and clean.</font>

89
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But leniency is best
for managing subordinates.</font>

90
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leniency</font>

91
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wins loyalty.</font>

92
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If those in power are too harsh,</font>

93
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how can their people bear it?</font>

94
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They toil and labor.</font>

95
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must have their share.</font>

96
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few petty gains mean nothing</font>

97
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to you, Your Highness,</font>

98
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but they can secure hearts and minds.</font>

99
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai,</font>

100
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly did not misjudge you.</font>

101
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be the Shadow Master</font>

102
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Nightfall Haven.</font>

103
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You honor me too much.</font>

104
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am but a humble scholar.</font>

105
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know little of trade and commerce.</font>

106
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not accept your refusal.</font>

107
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:07,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I value not only your intellect</font>

108
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but also your heart</font>

109
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that holds me dear.</font>

110
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards.</font>

111
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai,</font>

112
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from this day forward,</font>

113
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are the Shadow Master.</font>

114
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not disappoint me.</font>

115
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

116
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu,</font>

117
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is the truth of</font>

118
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince's illness?</font>

119
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

120
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince has been plagued
by heavy worries.</font>

121
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Combined with this wind chill,</font>

122
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it has caused the suppressed</font>

123
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bloodlure Poison within him to relapse.</font>

124
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison</font>

125
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is now spreading rapidly
through his body.</font>

126
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't we use blood to nourish blood?</font>

127
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past few years,</font>

128
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he has fought
countless battles for Beiyuan.</font>

129
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His vital energy is severely depleted.</font>

130
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nourishing blood with blood</font>

131
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only offers temporary relief.</font>

132
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the Bloodlure Poison relapses,</font>

133
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the pain pierces to the very marrow.</font>

134
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can only use acupuncture</font>

135
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to ease his suffering.</font>

136
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this continues,</font>

137
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid</font>

138
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he won't last until the Start of Autumn.</font>

139
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Halt!</font>

140
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

141
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is asleep.</font>

142
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever it is, report it tomorrow.</font>

143
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this is from the Imperial Palace.</font>

144
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both of you, come in.</font>

145
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

146
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I've dealt with the trivial matters
in my household,</font>

147
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will go and see His Majesty.</font>

148
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and deliver that reply.</font>

149
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

150
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

151
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

152
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you stare at me
with such bright eyes,</font>

153
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might get the wrong idea.</font>

154
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was born with large eyes.</font>

155
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They naturally look spirited.</font>

156
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so late.</font>

157
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still have to work?</font>

158
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many matters have piled up lately.</font>

159
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must be dealt with asap.</font>

160
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll stay with you.</font>

161
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With you standing right beside me,</font>

162
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I possibly focus?</font>

163
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you need to cough, just let it out.</font>

164
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

165
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how much longer do you plan
to hide this from me?</font>

166
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can put on a brave face</font>

167
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for outsiders,</font>

168
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but must you act tough in front of me?</font>

169
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu has told me everything.</font>

170
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it weren't for you being unwell,</font>

171
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the mere fact that you kept this from me</font>

172
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would have made me leave you long ago.</font>

173
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll cut Physician Liu's tongue.</font>

174
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu only told me</font>

175
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for your own good.</font>

176
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beiyuan has so many talented people,</font>

177
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you have only one body.</font>

178
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you so careless with yourself?</font>

179
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

180
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this poison is unpredictable.</font>

181
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm quite used to it.</font>

182
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing happened before.</font>

183
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, this time,</font>

184
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will also be fine.</font>

185
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can rest assured.</font>

186
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

187
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">King Yama wouldn't take
a wicked ghost like you.</font>

188
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nor would he take a fool like you.</font>

189
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, get back to work,</font>

190
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you can rest early.</font>

191
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yizhuang]</font>

192
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

193
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here.</font>

194
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are all medical books</font>

195
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found for you in my father's study.</font>

196
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a look first.</font>

197
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not enough,
I'll search the other studies for you.</font>

198
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, let me give you a massage.</font>

199
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know I'm good at this.</font>

200
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:23,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

201
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't turn me down.</font>

202
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

203
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

204
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is so ill.</font>

205
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He probably won't last much longer.</font>

206
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't you thought</font>

207
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about where you'll go
after leaving the mansion?</font>

208
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you go back</font>

209
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to your former profession?</font>

210
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is blessed by heaven.</font>

211
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe</font>

212
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter what hardship he faces,</font>

213
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will pull through.</font>

214
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There you go again.</font>

215
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

216
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

217
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">think about you,</font>

218
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

219
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that sickly prince.</font>

220
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

221
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the dynamic among you three is strange?</font>

222
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

223
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

224
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on in that head of yours?</font>

225
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

226
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing at all.</font>

227
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't just stand there. Out, now.</font>

228
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

229
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

230
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should head back first.</font>

231
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to talk with your brother.</font>

232
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

233
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You asked me to come.</font>

234
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, you're sending me away.</font>

235
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a noble lady.</font>

236
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a temper...</font>

237
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

238
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get mad.</font>

239
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

240
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go, then.</font>

241
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

242
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't we agree?</font>

243
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the case was closed,</font>

244
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd tell Prince Duan that you'd leave.</font>

245
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you still here?</font>

246
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you forgotten your job?</font>

247
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is gravely ill.</font>

248
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no one to manage his household.</font>

249
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

250
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need a few more days of leave.</font>

251
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is a prince.</font>

252
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many people can care for him.</font>

253
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're hardly the only one.</font>

254
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must you stay by his side?</font>

255
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you given up
on your brother's case?</font>

256
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation has changed.</font>

257
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rather than throwing eggs
against a rock,</font>

258
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's better to lean
against a large tree.</font>

259
00:11:58,720 --> 00:11:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean Prince Duan?</font>

260
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is merely the one
standing in the light.</font>

261
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one truly at daggers drawn
with Changle</font>

262
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is His Majesty.</font>

263
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, have you lost your mind?</font>

264
00:12:08,800 --> 00:12:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty's will is not yours to sway.</font>

265
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty's tolerance for Changle</font>

266
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will not last much longer.</font>

267
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need only wait here
and watch how things unfold.</font>

268
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There will be</font>

269
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an outcome soon.</font>

270
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When that happens,</font>

271
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will be my best chance
to free my brother.</font>

272
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let us hope
that is truly what you think.</font>

273
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has the Prince eaten?</font>

274
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He only took a few symbolic bites.</font>

275
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has been this way lately.</font>

276
00:12:59,360 --> 00:12:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

277
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave.</font>

278
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

279
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

280
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness. Your Highness.</font>

281
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink your medicine.</font>

282
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It hurts so much.</font>

283
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

284
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink.</font>

285
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

286
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it still hurt?</font>

287
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it still hurts, bite me.</font>

288
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's alright now.</font>

289
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's alright.</font>

290
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will always be with you.</font>

291
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's alright.</font>

292
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Apply this salve twice daily
in the mornings and evenings.</font>

293
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bite marks will fade soon.</font>

294
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for your trouble.</font>

295
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu.</font>

296
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I watch the Prince
take his medicine every day</font>

297
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and remind him not to overwork.</font>

298
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it that his illness</font>

299
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shows no sign of improvement,</font>

300
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the pain only worsens?</font>

301
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Given today's situation,</font>

302
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his blood is already useless</font>

303
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to his body.</font>

304
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His blood is useless...</font>

305
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what about mine?</font>

306
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's still blood.</font>

307
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mine is healthier than his.</font>

308
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

309
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you mustn't take such a risk.</font>

310
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This method has no basis at all.</font>

311
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

312
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would greatly harm your health.</font>

313
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Prince knew,</font>

314
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he would never allow it.</font>

315
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we won't tell him.</font>

316
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll only know whether it'll work</font>

317
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after we try.</font>

318
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to do this?</font>

319
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is gravely ill.</font>

320
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty sends people</font>

321
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to check on him every day.</font>

322
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems Prince Duan</font>

323
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is truly at death's door this time.</font>

324
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for your concern, Your Majesty.</font>

325
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a man of the battlefield.</font>

326
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Life and death mean little to me now.</font>

327
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You summoned me urgently.</font>

328
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be a matter
of great importance.</font>

329
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do have urgent matters
to discuss with you.</font>

330
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui.</font>

331
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

332
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son, Cui Tai,</font>

333
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a student at Shangxue Academy.</font>

334
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But at some point,</font>

335
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he suddenly began taking a substance</font>

336
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">called Divine Dust.</font>

337
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This drug</font>

338
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gives people a feeling of euphoria,</font>

339
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it gradually becomes addictive.</font>

340
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At home,</font>

341
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found some residue.</font>

342
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Upon analysis,</font>

343
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it turned out to be hemp.</font>

344
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hemp causes hallucinations,</font>

345
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">destroying the mind.</font>

346
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two years ago,</font>

347
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I declared it a prohibited substance.</font>

348
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once discovered,</font>

349
00:15:59,080 --> 00:15:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it must be completely destroyed.</font>

350
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

351
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it has resurfaced in a new form,</font>

352
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leaking out of Shangxue Academy.</font>

353
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear that behind this</font>

354
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lies an even more shocking conspiracy.</font>

355
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After I discovered this,</font>

356
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my son resolved to quit using it.</font>

357
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But a few days ago,</font>

358
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was suddenly found murdered</font>

359
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Scholar's Grove.</font>

360
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am certain</font>

361
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that it's connected to the plot.</font>

362
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui, my deepest condolences.</font>

363
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The students are
the future of our nation.</font>

364
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

365
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you have a plan?</font>

366
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cui Tai became addicted
at Shangxue Academy.</font>

367
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must send someone into the academy,</font>

368
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">follow the clues,</font>

369
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and trace it back to the source.</font>

370
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have someone in mind?</font>

371
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am willing to share your burden.</font>

372
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

373
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:50,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

374
00:16:51,290 --> 00:16:54,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

375
00:16:55,210 --> 00:16:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

376
00:16:59,890 --> 00:17:03,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

377
00:17:03,870 --> 00:17:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

378
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

379
00:17:12,730 --> 00:17:18,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

380
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

381
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:29,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

382
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:33,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

383
00:17:34,130 --> 00:17:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

384
00:17:38,110 --> 00:17:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

385
00:17:42,710 --> 00:17:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
